pub-id-type="pmid">16434585</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B5"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Duffy</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name><name><surname>Gabe</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Tabar</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Yen</surname><given-names>AMF</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>HHT</given-names></name><article-title>The randomized trials of breast cancer screening: what have we learned?</article-title><source>Radiol Clin Nth Amer</source><year>2004</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>793</fpage><lpage>806</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.rcl.2004.06.014</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>